{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Therefore you and all, etc.</b> The word <b>לָכֵן</b> is an oath, and the oath is that they are conspiring against HaShem. This is the sense of the matter: 'You and all your congregation, who are conspiring by oath — against HaShem you are conspiring to undermine His words.' And he said this so that perhaps they will take fright and tremble from persisting in the dispute."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:09:57.550046177Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}